    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always fascinated me—it’s like a language of patterns and logic that connects everything from physics to art. I enjoy its precision but also find it deeply rewarding when I can solve problems creatively, almost like solving puzzles. It’s both challenging and strangely calming, much like my love for classical music.",
